---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PartnerImage from '@/components/PartnerImage.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Arkansas Campaign Data Cooperative — Institutional Campaign Infrastructure"
  description="Executive-grade Arkansas campaign infrastructure: Electd operating system, L2 enhanced voter intelligence, cooperative data acquisition, and managed outreach."
  ogImage="/og/home.png"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-gradient"></div>
      <div class="hero-grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Statewide campaign infrastructure</p>
      <div class="hero-brand">
        <img
          class="hero-map"
          src="/assets/arkansas-logo.svg"
          width="220"
          height="200"
          alt="Outline map of Arkansas with town markers"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="brand-lockup">Arkansas Campaign Data Cooperative</p>
          <h1 transition:name="page-title">Better Data.<br />Better Organizing.<br />Better Campaigns.</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        An institutional stack for serious Arkansas campaigns:
        <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Electd</a> for execution,
        <a href="https://l2-data.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">L2</a> for enhanced voter
        intelligence, managed outreach when you need capacity—and private campaign relationships kept firewalled.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row home-hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/">Request a briefing</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/data/">Inspect the data architecture</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/cooperative/">Cooperative terms</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-cinema section-cinema-dark">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="cinema-split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> The organizing tax</p>
          <h2>Incomplete phones and emails slow every door, dial, and donation ask.</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            VAN and spreadsheets only work as well as the records behind them. Missing mobiles, broken addresses, and
            disconnected contacts are a quiet cost on every Arkansas race.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/problem/">Read the problem brief</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/van/">How this works with VAN</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="cinema-points stagger">
          <li>Outdated landlines instead of reachable mobiles</li>
          <li>Thin email coverage for digital programs</li>
          <li>Mailing addresses that bounce or waste postage</li>
          <li>Local knowledge trapped outside the voter file</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-cinema section-cinema-light">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="kicker">Problem → stack → execution</p>
      <h2>One Arkansas path from data to doors to digital.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Electd runs the campaign OS. L2 enhances the file when the cooperative funds. Managed service fills capacity
        gaps. Private contacts stay firewalled.
      </p>
      <div class="flow-rail stagger">
        <article class="flow-step">
          <span class="step-num">01 — Platform</span>
          <h3>Electd at $149/mo</h3>
          <p>Lists, CRM, canvass, phones, email, SMS, voice, mail—no contract.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flow-step">
          <span class="step-num">02 — Data</span>
          <h3>L2 cooperative file</h3>
          <p>Enhanced contacts and HaystaqDNA models, funded by published minimums.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flow-step">
          <span class="step-num">03 — Capacity</span>
          <h3>Managed outreach</h3>
          <p>Full-service email and SMS when your team needs execution support.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section offer-strip">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Operating capabilities</h2>
      <p class="lead">Each capability has its own page—built for decision-makers who need depth, not a brochure scroll.</p>
      <div class="topic-grid stagger">
        <a class="topic-card accent" href="/platform/">
          <h3>Electd Platform</h3>
          <p>$149/month, no contract. Political OS: lists, CRM, canvassing, phones, email, SMS, voice, mail.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Platform brief →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card accent" href="/data/">
          <h3>L2 Data Architecture</h3>
          <p>Identity, contact, districts, wealth, donors, automotive, digital IDs—plus HaystaqDNA models.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Data brief →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/models/">
          <h3>HaystaqDNA Models</h3>
          <p>160+ issue, behavior, candidate, and turnout scores (0–100) for precision targeting.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Models brief →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/cooperative/">
          <h3>Data Cooperative</h3>
          <p>Published figures are <strong>minimum</strong> contributions. Metro areas 50,000+ pay county rate.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Terms →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/managed/">
          <h3>Managed Outreach</h3>
          <p>Full-service email 1.5¢ · SMS 2.8¢—executed on Electd.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Managed →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="topic-card" href="/pricing/">
          <h3>Rate Card</h3>
          <p>Quoted Electd usage vs managed full-service, side by side.</p>
          <span class="topic-go">Rates →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-product">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Institutional partners</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        We package Arkansas organizing requirements with category-leading national infrastructure—and link you to the
        source for complete product documentation.
      </p>
      <div class="partner-band">
        <PartnerImage variant="electd-mark" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          <strong>Electd</strong> — political operating system for strategy, CRM, and multi-channel outreach.
          <a href="https://www.electd.io/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">electd.io</a> ·
          <a href="/platform/">Our brief</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-band">
        <PartnerImage variant="l2-logo" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          <strong>L2 Data</strong> — 50+ years of enhanced voter &amp; consumer intelligence.
          <a href="https://l2-data.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">l2-data.com</a> ·
          <a href="/data/">Our brief</a> ·
          <a href="/assets/L2-Voter-Data-Dictionary.pdf">Data dictionary (PDF)</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="exec-panel">
        <h3>For campaigns that can invest more</h3>
        <p>
          Cooperative contribution amounts are the <strong>minimum</strong> required to keep statewide acquisition
          affordable for the broadest set of participants. If your campaign can contribute above the minimum, please
          do—additional support strengthens the file for everyone.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/cooperative/#minimums">Read contribution policy →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="source-links">
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/problem/">The problem</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/privacy/">Private contacts</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/join/">Request a briefing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
